OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder of woman
OL,4,Ain Finglas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith the murder of a woman who was
OL,8,Ffound dead at a block of flats in the
OL,9,FRepublic of Ireland.
OL,11,FThe victim has been named locally as
OL,12,FLoredana Morosanu, who was in her 40s.
OL,14,FShe was originally from Romania but had
OL,15,Flived in Ireland for several years.
OL,17,FThe court heard the accused,
OL,18,F47-year-old Daniel Simion Toader, who
OL,19,Fis also Romanian, did not reply when
OL,20,Fgardai (Irish police) charged him with
OL,21,Fmurder.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
